comment.narrative:
Cropping Intensity = Total annual area cropped per unit command area. Cropped Area = sum of areas under crops during one agricultural year. Command area = nominal or design area to be irrigated (watercourse / scheme area for Component 1 and field area for HEIS under Component 2)

&nbsp;

Not yet estimated, to be monitored by June 2024

